sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor RM as Retail Manager
    participant UI as Web Client
    participant API as Express Server
    participant Stripe as Stripe Gateway
    participant DB as PostgreSQL DB
    participant R2 as Cloudflare R2
    participant Worker as Python AI Worker

    Note over RM, DB: 1. Subscribe to a Plan
    RM->>UI: Select plan & click Purchase / Upgrade
    UI->>API: POST /api/subscriptions/create (planId)
    API->>DB: Fetch user & plan details
    API->>Stripe: Create/get customer & create incomplete subscription
    API->>DB: Save INCOMPLETE subscription record
    API-->>UI: Return subscriptionId & clientSecret

    RM->>UI: Enter card details & confirm payment
    UI->>Stripe: Confirm card payment
    Stripe-->>UI: Payment succeeded
    Stripe->>API: Webhook: customer.subscription.updated (active)
    API->>DB: Update subscription status = ACTIVE & period end
    UI->>API: POST /api/subscriptions/sync
    API-->>UI: Return synced ACTIVE status
    UI-->>RM: Display Active Plan & expanded storage quota

    Note over RM, Worker: 2. Upload Dataset with Active Subscription
    RM->>UI: Select CSV file & click Upload
    UI->>API: POST /api/datasets/upload (CSV)
    API->>DB: Verify active subscription & remaining quota
    Note right of DB: usedStorageMb + fileSizeMb <= maxStorageMb
    API->>R2: Upload CSV file to storage
    API->>DB: Increment usedStorageMb & insert dataset
    API->>Worker: POST /analyze (dataset_id)
    API-->>UI: 200 Upload successful & analysis started
